{"seq":2,"slug":"mathematics","title":"七年级数学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"七年级数学-简介\">七年级数学 简介</h1><p>七年级数学是初中数学的奠基阶段：学生从小学的算术运算迈入代数思维，从直观看图走向几何推理。本 hub 聚焦七年级（人教版进度）三大主线——有理数、代数入门、几何基础，定位为&quot;打地基&quot;，目标是让运算扎实、会用字母建模、能做初步的几何说理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与相邻-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与相邻 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>本 hub 只覆盖七年级核心；上下游与平行学科各有分工，避免内容重叠：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>对应 hub</th>\n<th>分工</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>负数初识、字母表示数、简单方程</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../../primary/grade-6/mathematics/\">小学六年级数学</a></td>\n<td>算术到代数的过渡（本 hub 的前置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次函数、全等/相似、勾股定理、统计概率</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../grade-8/mathematics/\">八年级数学</a></td>\n<td>把方程升级为函数、几何从说理走向严格证明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次函数、圆、解直角三角形</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../grade-9/mathematics/\">九年级数学</a></td>\n<td>中考综合与函数几何深化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合、函数、数列</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../../high-school/year-1/mathematics/\">高一数学</a></td>\n<td>抽象化与系统化（本 hub 的远期去向）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用数学描述自然规律（力、温度、光）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../grade-8/physics/\">八年级物理</a></td>\n<td>数学是工具，物理是应用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比例尺、面积估算、坐标定位</td>\n<td><a href=\"../geography/\">七年级地理</a></td>\n<td>数轴/比例/面积在地理中的实际运用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：小学六年级负责&quot;铺垫负数与字母&quot;，本 hub 负责&quot;建立有理数运算体系 + 代数入门 + 几何说理起步&quot;，八九年级负责&quot;函数化与严格证明&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>知识有先后依赖，建议按以下顺序，不要跳读：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>有理数运算</strong>（第一章）：先 <a href=\"rational-numbers/integers-operations\">整数与运算</a> → <a href=\"rational-numbers/fractions-decimals\">分数与小数运算</a> → <a href=\"rational-numbers/number-line-abs\">数轴与绝对值</a>。这是全年最重要的&quot;计算关&quot;，必须练到熟练再往后走。</li>\n<li><strong>代数入门</strong>（第二章）：<a href=\"algebra-intro/algebraic-expressions\">代数式</a> → <a href=\"algebra-intro/linear-equations\">一元一次方程</a> → <a href=\"algebra-intro/inequalities\">不等式与不等式组</a>。方程与不等式解法高度相似，建议对照学习。</li>\n<li><strong>几何基础</strong>（第三章）：<a href=\"geometry-basics/line-angle\">线段角与相交线</a> → <a href=\"geometry-basics/triangle-properties\">三角形性质</a> → <a href=\"geometry-basics/plane-figures\">平面图形面积</a>。几何与前两章相对独立，可在代数学习的间隙穿插推进。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>分人群建议：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>同步学习的学生</strong>：跟随课堂进度，每章学完做完文末&quot;练习与思考&quot;，把错题整理进错题本。有理数运算每天保持 10 分钟限时计算练习。</li>\n<li><strong>自主预习者</strong>：可先通读每篇&quot;知识要点&quot;与表格建立框架，再回头攻&quot;详细讲解&quot;，预习阶段重在理解概念、不必追求做难题。</li>\n<li><strong>需要补差的学生</strong>：优先回到第一章有理数，符号错误几乎是七年级丢分的最大来源；几何部分先确保会&quot;看图说理&quot;，再追求规范书写。</li>\n<li><strong>家长</strong>：可借&quot;知识要点&quot;表格快速了解每个主题的考查重点，用文末练习题判断孩子的掌握程度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>进入本 hub 前，最好已掌握：四则运算与运算顺序、分数与小数的基本运算、常见平面图形（长方形、三角形、圆）的面积公式、用字母表示数的初步经验。若这些较弱，建议先回顾 <a href=\"../../../primary/grade-6/mathematics/\">小学六年级数学</a> 中的负数、用字母表示数与方程过渡内容。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rational-numbers","title":"有理数","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/rational-numbers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"integers-operations","title":"七年级数学 — 整数与运算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/rational-numbers/integers-operations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fractions-decimals","title":"七年级数学 — 分数与小数运算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/rational-numbers/fractions-decimals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"number-line-abs","title":"七年级数学 — 数轴与绝对值","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/rational-numbers/number-line-abs"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algebra-intro","title":"代数入门","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"algebraic-expressions","title":"七年级数学 — 代数式","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro/algebraic-expressions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-equations","title":"七年级数学 — 一元一次方程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro/linear-equations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"inequalities","title":"七年级数学 — 不等式与不等式组","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/algebra-intro/inequalities"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"geometry-basics","title":"几何基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/geometry-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"line-angle","title":"七年级数学 — 线段角与相交线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/geometry-basics/line-angle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"triangle-properties","title":"七年级数学 — 三角形性质","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/geometry-basics/triangle-properties"},{"seq":3,"slug":"plane-figures","title":"七年级数学 — 平面图形面积","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-7/mathematics/geometry-basics/plane-figures"}]}]}